b.p('These routes exist in current source. A cron hook is not enabled merely because its file exists: verify the scheduling migration, configured APP_URL/target origin, CRON_SECRET and heartbeat. Provider webhook routes require their signature protocol instead of the cron secret. Extracted interval values are code expectations, not a live scheduler inspection.')
